<![CDATA[2_0 Added Greyout feature : W.E.H. 2020-01-14
3_0 Removed buttonstatus (for presshold), updated for progress wheel graphic  DNG 2020-12-10
3_1 Added "Out" to replace using EnableOut which has issues because it updates based on EnableIn]]>
</RevisionNote>
