</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="SINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="Vendor_ID" TagType="Base" DataType="INT" Usage="Output" Radix="Decimal" Required="false" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Read only value indicating the manufacturer of the IO-Link Device. ifm=310 dec]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="INT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="Device_ID" TagType="Base" DataType="DINT" Usage="Output" Radix="Decimal" Required="false" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Read only value set by the manufacturer of the device. Varies by product family]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="DINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="IOL_Mode" TagType="Base" DataType="BOOL" Usage="Output" Radix="Decimal" Required="false" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[True: Port is configured for IO-Link Communication. False: Port is not configured for IO-Link Communication]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="BOOL" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="Device_Not_Connected" TagType="Base" DataType="BOOL" Usage="Output" Radix="Decimal" Required="false" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[True: No IO-Link Device is connected
False: IO-Link Device is connected]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="BOOL" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="Invalid_Data" TagType="Base" DataType="BOOL" Usage="Output" Radix="Decimal" Required="false" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[True: IO-Link Data is invalid False: IO-Link Data is valid]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="BOOL" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="Wrong_VID_DID" TagType="Base" DataType="BOOL" Usage="Output" Radix="Decimal" Required="false" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[True: Vendor ID and/or Device ID does not match the configured VID or DID set in Configuration Controller Tag(s) <IOLink MasterName>:C.Vendor_ID_Port_n or ...C.Device_ID_Port_n]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="BOOL" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="Diagnostic_Avail" TagType="Base" DataType="BOOL" Usage="Output" Radix="Decimal" Required="false" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[True: IO-Link Event data is available False: No Event data is present]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="BOOL" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="AOI_Settings_Error" TagType="Base" DataType="BOOL" Usage="Output" Radix="Decimal" Required="false" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[A user input is out of range. Check port process data size and port number]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="BOOL" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
<Parameter Name="Counter" TagType="Base" DataType="INT" Usage="Output" Radix="Decimal" Required="false" Visible="true" ExternalAccess="Read Only">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Current counter value]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="INT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</Parameter>
</Parameters>
<LocalTags>
<LocalTag Name="Data_Size" DataType="SINT" Radix="Decimal" ExternalAccess="None">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Factor of the RealPort_Num to calcualated the Offset_Address]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="SINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
<LocalTag Name="Offset_Address" DataType="INT" Radix="Decimal" ExternalAccess="None">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Result of Data_Size*RealPort_Number]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="INT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
<LocalTag Name="Offset_StatusFlgs" DataType="SINT" Radix="Decimal" ExternalAccess="None">
<Description>
<![CDATA[RealPort_Num+9]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="SINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
<LocalTag Name="Process_Offset" DataType="INT" Radix="Decimal" ExternalAccess="None">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Result of Offset_Address+95(8port Master) or Offset_Address+59(4port Master). Used to indicate the word offset for where the IO-Link device’s process input data starts]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="INT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
<LocalTag Name="RealPort_Num" DataType="SINT" Radix="Decimal" ExternalAccess="None">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Result of the Port_Number-1]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="SINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
<LocalTag Name="StatusFlgs_Offset" DataType="SINT" Radix="Decimal" ExternalAccess="None">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Result of Offset_StatusFlgs+23]]>
</Description>
<DefaultData Format="L5K">
<![CDATA[0]]>
</DefaultData>
<DefaultData Format="Decorated">
<DataValue DataType="SINT" Radix="Decimal" Value="0"/>
</DefaultData>
</LocalTag>
</LocalTags>
<Routines>
<Routine Name="Logic" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Calculate Data_Size depending on Port_Process_Data_Size input by the user]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[EQ(Port_Process_Data_Size,0) MOVE(1,Data_Size) ,EQ(Port_Process_Data_Size,1) MOVE(2,Data_Size) ,EQ(Port_Process_Data_Size,2) MOVE(4,Data_Size) ,EQ(Port_Process_Data_Size,3) MOVE(8,Data_Size) ,EQ(Port_Process_Data_Size,4) MOVE(16,Data_Size) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[If the user input Port_Number <= to the maximum number of ports on the IO-Link master (4 or 8) and the Port_Number != to 0 then 
calculate the Process_Offset  (if process input data is produced by the IO-Link Device) and/or calculate the Process_Value_Offset (if process output data is consumed by the IO-Link Device). 
Parallel to the Calculation of the Process_Offset and/or Process_Value_Offset calculate the value of the StatusFlgs_Offset
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[LE(Port_Number,8)GT(Port_Number,0)SUB(Port_Number,1,RealPort_Num)[MUL(Data_Size,RealPort_Num,Offset_Address) ADD(Offset_Address,95,Process_Offset) ,MUL(9,RealPort_Num,Offset_StatusFlgs) ADD(Offset_StatusFlgs,23,StatusFlgs_Offset) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Sets states of IOL_Mode, Device_Not_Connected, Invalid_Data, Wrong_VID_DID and Diagnostic Available and set the values for the Vendor ID and Device ID from the Controller input tags of the user input Port_Number
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(PLC_Input[StatusFlgs_Offset].0) OTE(IOL_Mode) ,XIC(PLC_Input[StatusFlgs_Offset].1) OTE(Device_Not_Connected) ,XIC(PLC_Input[StatusFlgs_Offset].2) OTE(Invalid_Data) ,XIC(PLC_Input[StatusFlgs_Offset].3) OTE(Wrong_VID_DID) ,XIC(PLC_Input[StatusFlgs_Offset].7) OTE(Diagnostic_Avail) ,MOVE(PLC_Input[StatusFlgs_Offset+1],Vendor_ID) ,COP(PLC_Input[StatusFlgs_Offset+2],Device_ID,1) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Set the State of AOI_Setting_Error by verifying the user input setting of Port_Number and Port_Process_Data_Size is within range of the IO-Link Master. GRT instruction for Port_Number compares to value=8 for 8 port masters and =4 for 4 port masters]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[LE(Port_Number,0) ,GT(Port_Number,8) ,LT(Port_Process_Data_Size,0) ,GT(Port_Process_Data_Size,4) ]OTE(AOI_Settings_Error);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[MOVE(PLC_Input[Process_Offset],Counter);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</AddOnInstructionDefinition>
