</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="Logic" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[MOVE(0,ProgramID);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[When communications are active with the main PLC, the NoMachineFaults bit (and Warnings) comes from the main PLC. This is because when comms are active, the deflasher sends its faut active bit to the main PLC, then the main PLC combines it with its own NoFault bit and then sends the combined status back to this PLC.
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(\Main.FaultActive)XIO(\Safety.FaultActive)XIO(\Motion.FaultActive)XIO(\HMI.FaultActive)XIO(\Comms.FaultActive)OTE(HMI_Data.Status.Alarms.NoFaults)OTE(NoMachineFaults);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(\Main.WarningActive)XIO(\Motion.WarningActive)XIO(\HMI.WarningActive)XIO(\Comms.WarningActive)OTE(NoMachineWarnings);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[When the connection to the main machine is active the Active Alarm array is sent to the Main PLC. Then is it updated in the Main PLC and sent to this PLC.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[COP(Active[0],ActiveHMI[0],3)COP(Active[3],ActiveHMI[3],3);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Clear the Active Alarm list in case it has been corrupted via a PLC program download.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(S:FS) ,XIC(NoMachineWarnings) XIC(NoMachineFaults) ONS(OneShot.5) ,XIC(DG_Debug_ClearAlarms) ONS(OneShot.11) ]COP(AlarmDataEmpty,Active[0],1)COP(Active[0],Active[1],15);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Manual clearing of alarm history]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[HMI_OutMom(HMI_ClrAlmHistory,1,2000,0,0,1,0,\Security.Level,0,1);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(HMI_ClrAlmHistory.Out)XIC(\Comms.MainPLCActive)COP(AlarmDataEmpty,History[0],1)COP(History[0],History[1],49);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[***HMI ALARM HANDLING***
Logic for handling the alarm displays developed for the PV5500.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Show Alarm popup when an alarm is present]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(NoMachineFaults)ONS(OneShot.0)NE(\HMI.CurrentPopupNum,90)NE(\HMI.CurrentScreenNum,91)MOVE(90,\HMI.ReplaceScreenNum);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Close "Active Alarms" popup 90 or "All Active Alarms" screen 91 (If its showing) within the first second of all alarms clearing.

Writing 9999 to \HMI.ReplaceScreenNum will close the pop up being displayed on the HMI
Writing 8888 to \HMI.ReplaceScreenNum will execute a NavBack command to return to previous screen on the HMI]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(NoMachineWarnings)XIC(NoMachineFaults)TON(Tmr_DlyClose,?,?)XIO(Tmr_DlyClose.DN)[EQ(\HMI.CurrentPopupNum,90) ONS(OneShot.1) MOVE(9999,\HMI.ReplaceScreenNum) ,EQ(\HMI.CurrentScreenNum,91) ONS(OneShot.10) MOVE(8888,\HMI.ReplaceScreenNum) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Alarm History Display]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="11" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(S:FS)[SIZE(History[0],0,HistSize) ,SIZE(HistoryDisplay[0],0,S_DispSize) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="12" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[EQ(\HMI.CurrentScreenNum,99)[ONS(OneShot.2) MOVE(0,DisplayListPointer) ,XIC(HistoryNav.PageUp) ONS(OneShot.3) [GE(DisplayListPointer,S_DispSize) CPT(DisplayListPointer,(DisplayListPointer+HistSize-S_DispSize-S_DispSize+1)MOD(HistSize-S_DispSize+1)) OTE(OneShot.8) ,XIO(OneShot.8) LT(DisplayListPointer,S_DispSize) MOVE(0,DisplayListPointer) ] ,XIC(HistoryNav.ScrollDown) ONS(OneShot.4) CPT(DisplayListPointer,(DisplayListPointer+1)MOD(HistSize-S_DispSize+1)) ,XIC(HistoryNav.ScrollUp) ONS(OneShot.6) CPT(DisplayListPointer,(DisplayListPointer+HistSize-S_DispSize)MOD(HistSize-S_DispSize+1)) ,XIC(HistoryNav.PageDown) ONS(OneShot.7) CPT(tempPtrCheck,HistSize-S_DispSize-S_DispSize) [LT(DisplayListPointer,tempPtrCheck) CPT(DisplayListPointer,(DisplayListPointer+S_DispSize)MOD(HistSize-S_DispSize+1)) OTE(OneShot.9) ,XIO(OneShot.9) GE(DisplayListPointer,tempPtrCheck) CPT(DisplayListPointer,HistSize-S_DispSize) ] ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="13" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[LIMIT(0,DisplayListPointer,HistSize)CMP(HistSize-DisplayListPointer>S_DispSize)COP(History[DisplayListPointer],HistoryDisplay[0],S_DispSize);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="14" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[AlarmFilter(AOI_AlarmFilter,Active,Filtered,HMI_FilterMask);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="15" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[JSR(ActiveCount,0);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</Program>
